OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as mural vandalised hours
OL,4,Aafter unveiling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a new
OL,7,Ffootball mural near Molineux in
OL,8,FWolverhampton was vandalised with blue
OL,9,Fpaint, hours after it was unveiled.
OL,11,FThe artwork, situated at the entrance
OL,12,Fof Molineux Subway, was damaged on
OL,13,FSaturday evening, said West Midlands
OL,14,FPolice.
OL,16,FThe mural was unveiled on Saturday to
OL,17,Fcelebrate 150 years of Wolverhampton
OL,18,FWanderers at Molineux.
OL,20,FAn 18-year-old man was arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of criminal damage and
OL,22,Fremains in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
